  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Co-development of a Humanitarian What Works Centre</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Humanitarian What Works Centre (HWWC) is a new initiative co-led by Elrha and the International Rescue Committee (IRC), designed to transform how research and innovation address critical challenges in humanitarian settings. In an era of escalating crises andconstrained resources, the Centre will support the development of evidence-based, scalable, and cost-effective solutions to high-impact problems facing crisis-affected communities.</narrative>
  </description>
